EEXXAAMMPPLLEESS
     Add the following to _/_e_t_c_/_b_g_p_d_._c_o_n_f to have bgpd(8) open a second, re‐
     stricted, control socket:

           socket "/var/run/bgpd.rsock" restricted

     An example setup in httpd(8) is:

                   location "/bgplgd/*" {
                           fastcgi socket "/run/bgplgd.sock"
                           request strip 1
                   }

